<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Awaken</h1>
<p>Sphere: Protection Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 7)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast awaken &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast awaken</a>   (on yourself)
</pre>
<p>Breaks a magic sleep: someone put to sleep by a sleep spell (see 
<a cmd='#'>Help Spell Sleep</a>) feels less sleepy and can wake up. It works if your 
spell is at least as strong as the sleep spell was; if not, they sleep on.
</p><p>You can cast it even while you are asleep yourself, to break a sleep spell on 
you. It does nothing for someone who is just sleeping: to wake them, see 
<a cmd='#'>Help Position</a>. It is also found on potions, wands, scrolls and staffs.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Spell Sleep</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Dispel Magic</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Position</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Protection Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>